          <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>The Holy-Affirming (Rigpa):</strong> The baseline operating system of the universe is <em>Rigpa</em>—pure, self-perfected, non-dual awareness. It is not a state to be achieved; it is the default frequency that exists beneath all Demiurgic noise.</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>The Holy-Denying (The Gradual Trap):</strong> The most insidious Archontic trap is the illusion of "spiritual progress." The belief that you must meditate, purify, and climb a ladder to reach enlightenment only reinforces the Ego (the localized seeker).</li>
